@RosterId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Roster with its league, season, players and staff (take the id from GET /rosters)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters/{{RosterId}}
Accept: application/json

### Error: the roster does not exist (404)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Error: the id is not a GUID (404, the route does not match)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rosters/not-a-guid
Accept: application/json
